---
import { SITE } from "../data/site";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Cookie Policy — Joyo Digitama Solusi"
  description="Cookie Policy for PT Joyo Digitama Solusi: this site sets one language cookie, our host Cloudflare may set security cookies, and there are no tracking cookies."
  path="cookies"
>
  <div class="legal-content reveal">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 3, 2026</p>

    <p>This Cookie Policy explains which cookies are set when you visit the PT Joyo Digitama Solusi website (joyodigitama.com). The short version: we use one cookie to remember your language, and we do not use analytics, advertising, or social-media tracking cookies.</p>

    <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files that a website stores in your browser. They let a site remember information between page loads, such as a preference you chose.</p>

    <h2>2. Cookies We Set</h2>
    <p>We set a single first-party cookie, and only when you use the language toggle (EN/ID):</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Name:</strong> <code>jd_lang</code></li>
      <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> Remembers whether you prefer English or Bahasa Indonesia, so we can show the right version of the site</li>
      <li><strong>Values:</strong> <code>en</code> or <code>id</code></li>
      <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 1 year</li>
      <li><strong>Type:</strong> Strictly functional. It contains no personal information and is not used for tracking. It is sent with <code>SameSite=Lax</code></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies Set by Our Hosting Provider</h2>
    <p>This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may set strictly necessary cookies (for example <code>__cf_bm</code>) to protect the site from bots and abuse and to keep it running reliably. These cookies are not used by us for analytics or advertising. For details, see <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/cookie-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare's Cookie Policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>4. What We Do Not Use</h2>
    <p>This website does not use analytics cookies, advertising or retargeting cookies, social-media pixels, or login cookies. We do not store anything you type into the contact form: sending it opens your own email app.</p>

    <h2>5. Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can view, delete, or block cookies in your browser settings, usually under Privacy or Site Data. If you block or clear the <code>jd_lang</code> cookie, the site still works; it will simply not remember your language choice. Blocking Cloudflare's security cookies may cause some visits to be challenged or blocked.</p>

    <h2>6. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about our use of cookies or this Cookie Policy, please contact us:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></li>
      <li>WhatsApp: <a href={`https://wa.me/${SITE.phoneWa}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{SITE.phoneDisplay}</a></li>
      <li>Address: Malang, East Java, Indonesia</li>
    </ul>
    <p>For more information about how we handle your personal data, please see our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
